<main class="gira-club-page">
  <div class="gira-container gira-club-container">
    <section class="gira-club-hero" aria-labelledby="gira-club-title"><p class="gira-club-eyebrow">GIRA CLUB</p><p class="gira-club-free">FREE TO JOIN</p><h1 id="gira-club-title">JOIN THE CLUB.<br>FIND YOUR SPARK.</h1><p>GIRA CLUBへの会員登録は無料。</p></section>
    {% if settings.gira_sparks_enabled %}
      <aside class="gira-club-gift"><p>WELCOME GIFT</p><strong>1,000 SPARKS <span aria-hidden="true">⚡</span></strong><p>新規会員登録でもれなくプレゼント。<br>もらったSPARKSは、登録後すぐにお買い物で使えます。</p></aside>
    {% endif %}
    <section class="gira-club-benefits" aria-labelledby="gira-club-benefits-title"><div class="gira-club-section-heading"><p>01</p><h2 id="gira-club-benefits-title">MEMBER BENEFITS</h2></div><ul>{% if settings.gira_sparks_enabled %}<li>お買い物でSPARKSが貯まる</li><li>SPARKSをお会計で利用できる</li>{% else %}<li>プロフィールを確認・管理できる</li><li>配送先住所を管理できる</li>{% endif %}<li>ORDER HISTORYをいつでも確認できる</li></ul></section>
    {% if settings.gira_sparks_enabled %}
    <section class="gira-club-sparks" aria-labelledby="gira-club-sparks-title"><p>02 / GIRA CLUB</p><h2 id="gira-club-sparks-title">SPARKS</h2><p>Earn SPARKS every time you shop.</p><dl><div><dt>1 SPARK</dt><dd>¥1 SPENT</dd></div><div><dt>20 SPARKS</dt><dd>¥1 REWARD</dd></div></dl></section>
    {% endif %}
    <a class="gira-club-join" href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}">JOIN / SIGN IN</a>
  </div>
</main>
